      en: ["Koulikoro is situated about 60 kilometers northeast of the capital, Bamako.", "The town serves as the terminus for the historic Dakar-Niger railway line.", "The Koulikoro port is a primary hub for river-borne freight and travel.", "Mangoes and bananas are extensively cultivated along the fertile riverbanks.", "The region is renowned for its traditional pinasse boat-building workshops.", "Koulikoro functions as the administrative capital of its namesake region."],
